---
const pageTitle = "Home"
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import InfoBox from '../components/InfoBox.astro';
import Skills from '../components/SkillsItems.jsx';
---
<BaseLayout pageTitle = {pageTitle}>
	<!-- slot in base layout -->
	<section>
		<h1 id ="h1HomePage">About Me</h1>
		<section id="aboutMeContent">
			<div class="container">
				<img src="/TriangleCatFinalBlue.jpg" alt="image made of triangles of a black cat sitting in pot of flowers with blue background">
			</div>
			<div class="container">
				<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.
				Vestibulum fermentum lacus eu elit pretium, ac gravida dolor suscipit.
				Donec porttitor, mauris consectetur egestas auctor, magna ex laoreet justo, ut pulvinar purus lorem ut est.
				Nunc pharetra tristique leo, ac malesuada massa cursus id.
				Curabitur dapibus quam facilisis, pellentesque neque eleifend, laoreet neque.
				Aenean id elit consequat, consequat sem sed, ullamcorper nulla.
				Aenean imperdiet libero vel tellus sodales posuere.
				Morbi dolor dolor, dignissim ac imperdiet et, feugiat ac lorem.
				Phasellus dapibus condimentum nibh sit amet porttitor.
				Pellentesque nec tristique enim, ut rutrum ligula.
				Morbi dictum bibendum ligula et tincidunt.
				Fusce faucibus metus ut nulla dictum aliquet.
				Aliquam sed tristique eros, ut viverra magna.</p>
				<button><strong>Download Resume</strong></button>
			</div>
		</section>
		<h2>Experience</h2>
		<div id="experienceBoxes">
			<section>
				<InfoBox infoBoxTitle = "Skills">
					<div class="skills">
						<Skills />
						<Skills />
						<Skills />
						<Skills />
						<Skills />
					</div>
				</InfoBox>
			</section>
			<section class = "full__two_column">
				<InfoBox infoBoxTitle = "Jobs">
					<div class = "jobs">
						<div>
							<div class = "titleInfo">
								<p><strong>Production Technician</strong></p>
								<p>September 2025 - Present</p>
							</div>
							<ul>
								<li>Allegheny Playshop</li>
								<li>520 North Main Street</li>
								<li>Erie, PA 16335</li>
								<li>Supervisor: LeeAnn Yeckley</li>
								<li>Duties: Rigging, cutting, assembling, electrics, cleaning</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
						<div>
							<div class="titleInfo">
								<p><strong>IT Intern</strong></p>
								<p>Summers July 2024 - August 2025</p>
							</div>
							<ul>
								<li>Comfort Care & Resources</li>
								<li>3520 W. 26th St.</li>
								<li>Erie, PA 16506</li>
								<li>Supervisor: Louis Rieger</li>
								<li>Duties: Writing functions; debugging code; testing live data; organizing website visuals</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
					</div>
				</InfoBox>
				<InfoBox infoBoxTitle = "Classes" >
					<div class = "classes">
						<div>
							<div class = "titleInfo">
								<p><strong>Allegheny College</strong></p>
								<p>Expected Graduation 2028</p>
							</div>
							<ul>
								<li>520 North Main Street</li>
								<li>Erie, PA 16335</li>
								<li>Relevant computer science coursework: Data Structures, Document Engineering, Programming Languages, Web Design, Operating Systems</li>
								<li>Relevant art coursework: Painting I, Sculpture I, Ceramics I, Electronice & Intermedia Art, Contemporary Strategies in Art</li>
								<li>Double-Major: Software Engineering and Art, Science, and Innovation</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
						<div>
							<div class="titleInfo">
								<p><strong>McDowell High School</strong></p>
								<p>June 2024</p>
							</div>
							<ul>
								<li>3580 West 38th Street</li>
								<li>Erie, PA 16506</li>
								<li>Relevant computer science coursework: Computer Science 1, Computer Science 2, Game Development and Programming, AP Computer Science Principles, AP Computer Science A, Web Design, Web Development</li>
								<li>Relevant art coursework: Drawing 1, Drawing 2, Drawing 3, Animation, Graphic Arts</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
					</div>
				</InfoBox>
			</section>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>